   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>You can easily update the mod to work with version 3.9.x<br />\nDownload the mod and update 2 files:</p>\n<p>in package.json replace</p>\n<p>\u201cakiVersion\u201d: \u201c~3.8.3\u201d,<br />\nto<br />\n\u201csptVersion\u201d: \u201c3.9.*\u201d,</p>\n<p>and in mod.ts replace all the imports</p>\n<p>from\u201c@spt-aki/\u2026.<br />\nto<br />\nfrom\u201c@spt/</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
